        "text": "Historical-vintage limitation: the fetched history uses current O rows. CMS permits corrections to submissions, so these rows establish the original-outcome variant but do not prove archived first-publication values. August 2026 must resolve on its initially published O row without later correction or U substitution. Initial network transport attempts failed; subsequent successful API responses supplied the numerical history."
