        "text": "Prior/update/interval: use a persistence prior with partial mean reversion, based on the 12 fetched monthly O shares. Level prior=68.758194%; mean-reversion adjustment=0.5*(70.229045-68.758194)=+0.735425 percentage points; momentum=0, one-off=0, incremental policy=0. Point=69.493620%, rounded to 69.5%. For the 11 successive unrounded monthly changes, mean change=-0.556745 and sum of squared deviations=695.148288; sigma = 8.337555 percentage points = sqrt(695.148288/(11-1)). The one-month 80% half-width is 1.28*sigma=10.672071. Scale by sqrt(2) for the June-to-August horizon: half-width=15.092587. Bounds=69.493620 +/- 15.092587=[54.401032,84.586207], rounded to [54.4,84.6]."
